  "id": "chicken-stroganoff",
  "name": "Chicken Stroganoff",
  "subtitle": "Creamy chicken skillet with mustard and paprika",
  "description": "Tender chicken simmers in a savory paprika, mustard, and Worcestershire sauce with a creamy finish. Serve over rice, mash, or pasta.",
